  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24d40aa119202dd62d62c111ccdfa91936e05700.png\" alt=\"Better Keys 標題\"></p>\n<h2><strong>讓試煉鑰匙擁有全新的造型與視覺效果，更加迷人、獨特且帶有詭譎氣息。設計靈感源自舊版 Origin Realms 的箱子鑰匙，並向其致敬。</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db4467dc6ef27c2d01bb4da32f6eff9834315c0d.png\" alt=\"鑰匙\">&nbsp;同樣兼容於&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fdungeons-and-taverns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeons And Taverns</a></p>\n<p>查看我的其他資源包：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252famoozing-cows\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Amoozing 牛群</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fcluckin-chicks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cluckin' 小雞</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-bats\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>更佳的蝙蝠</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fmob-items\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>生物物品</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fenchantrax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ENCHANTRAX</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-keys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>更佳的鑰匙</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252firidescent-star\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>虹彩之星</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fgolem-toys\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>傀儡玩具</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>&bull; 資源包由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fMarkiS_arts\" rel=\"nofollow\">itsMarkiS &bull; @Markis_ArtS</a> 製作</h4>",
